    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Fourteen-year-old Komori Shuri is a junior high school girl who is too nice to decline requests. Constantly doing favors for other people has given her incredible strength?! But even so, she is also an adolescent junior high school girl.",
        "jpn": "優しすぎて頼み事を断れない、女子中学生・小森しゅり。\r\n頼みごとをこなすウチに、いつしかすごい能力が身について!?\r\nそんな彼女もやっぱり思春期の中学生。\r\n日常生活には楽しいこと、嬉しいことが満ち溢れています!"
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "Komori-san wa Kotowarenai!",
        "Komori-san Can't Decline"
    ],
