                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Komori-san is Strong!",
                        "jpn": "小森さんは力持ち！"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "The girls think that Komori-san acts a little bit too much like a guy, but they realize quickly their assumptions may have been incorrect…",
                        "jpn": "相変わらず、みんなに頼まれるしゅり。雑用をこなしてゆくうちにすっかり力持ちに。態度もおっさんぽいと指摘するめぐみとまさ子だが…。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "3": {
                    "ID": "5358843",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/komori-san-cant-decline/episodes/5358843",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Komori-san is Popular!",
                        "jpn": "小森さんは人気者！"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Shuri can't decline the absurd requests Megumi and Masako throw at her. Looking at how everyone in class relies on Shuri, Megumi comes to a realization and…",
                        "jpn": "めぐみやまさ子の無茶な頼みごとも断らないしゅり。クラスでもみんながしゅりを頼ってくるが、そんな様子を見ためぐみは…。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "4": {
                    "ID": "5358844",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/komori-san-cant-decline/episodes/5358844",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Komori-san Can Do Anything?",
                        "jpn": "小森さんは何でも屋？"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "The athletic Shuri gets asked to participate in the volleyball team's match, but she finds it hard to make plays. Megumi gets worried about her and…",
                        "jpn": "運動神経のいいしゅりはバレー部の試合の助っ人を頼まれるが、なかな上手く活躍できない。そんなしゅりを心配しためぐみは…。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "5": {
                    "ID": "5358845",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/komori-san-cant-decline/episodes/5358845",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Negishi-san Has It All Covered!",
                        "jpn": "根岸さんはソツがない！"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Megumi gets the feeling that Shuri declines her often, and Masako, who insists she won't be declined, seems to be relied upon frequently as the class rep.",
                        "jpn": "しゅりによく断られる気がするというめぐみ、絶対に断らせないというまさ子。\r\nそういうまさ子は学級委員として結構よく頼られているようだが。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "6": {
                    "ID": "5358846",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/komori-san-cant-decline/episodes/5358846",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Ootani-kun wants to be relied on!",
                        "jpn": "大谷くんは頼られたい！"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Otani proclaims he will never ask Shuri for help, and Shuri says he'll let Otani take care of everything himself, but...",
                        "jpn": "クラスメートの大谷くんから、しゅりには絶対に頼らない！と唐突に宣言をされたしゅりは、わかった、まかせろ！と、それも引き受けるが。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "7": {
                    "ID": "5360218",
                    "TYPE": null,
